<v Johnson>Has he had prior counsel?
<v Johnson>他有之前的辩护律师吗？

00:38:18.590 --> 00:38:28.790
<v Virginia Martinez>Not for us, I don't think. He had the same counsel with Sayles for the appeal, but after that, I don't think he's had an attorney.
<v Virginia Martinez>我不认为是我们这里的。他在上诉时和赛尔斯有同样的辩护律师，但那之后，我不认为他还有过律师。

00:38:28.790 --> 00:38:33.770
<v Craig Findley>I don't think he's ever been represented before, but he's been eligible for parole--
<v Craig Findley>我不认为他之前有过代理律师，但他一直有资格假释——

00:38:33.770 --> 00:38:34.220
<v Virginia Martinez>19--
<v Virginia Martinez>19——

00:38:34.220 --> 00:38:34.640
<v Craig Findley>--previously--
<v Craig Findley>——以前——

00:38:34.640 --> 00:38:35.480
<v Virginia Martinez>--81.
<v Virginia Martinez>——81年。

00:38:35.480 --> 00:38:36.370
<v Craig Findley>--for a very long time.
<v Craig Findley>——很长一段时间了。

00:38:36.370 --> 00:38:58.800
<v Virginia Martinez>1981, he came before us for the first time. In all that time, he's gotten one vote. And there was, actually, also a statement in one of those decisions about, he needed a little more time. You have it now.
<v Virginia Martinez>1981 年，他第一次出现在我们面前。在那段时间里，他只获得过一张赞成票。事实上，其中一个决定中也有一份声明说，他还需要一点时间。你现在有了。

00:38:58.800 --> 00:39:23.580
<v Virginia Martinez>But it was '83-- it might have been later-- that the board said he needed a little more time. He's had it. He's had 46 years. I believe that he's been rehabilitated. And I believe that he presents an acceptable risk. And so I move that we--
<v Virginia Martinez>但那是 83 年——也许更晚一些——委员会说他还需要一点时间。他已经有那个时间了。他已经服刑 46 年了。我相信他已经完成了改造。我相信他构成可接受的风险。所以我动议我们——

00:39:23.580 --> 00:39:25.830
<v Perkins>Overruled. Did you say--
<v Perkins>驳回。你是说——

