<v Perkins>Did you say he just had four tickets in--
<v Perkins>你说他只收到四次违纪记录在——

00:39:33.570 --> 00:39:35.130
<v Virginia Martinez>30 years.
<v Virginia Martinez>30年里。

00:39:35.130 --> 00:39:36.510
<v Lisa Daniels>Four tickets in 30 years.
<v Lisa Daniels>30年里四次违纪记录。

00:39:36.510 --> 00:39:39.820
<v Virginia Martinez>At Stateville. At Stateville. I keep thinking about that.
<v Virginia Martinez>在斯泰特维尔。在斯泰特维尔。我一直想着这件事。

00:39:39.820 --> 00:39:41.110
<v Craig Findley>Easy place to get tickets.
<v Craig Findley>那是很容易收到违纪记录的地方。

00:39:41.110 --> 00:39:41.530
<v Virginia Martinez>Yes.
<v Virginia Martinez>是的。

